# The guard's runtime tree, at the paths config/server-guard.example.json
# defaults to: the evidence store, the pseudonym identity map, and the HMAC
# key. The identity map is the half that unmasks every pseudonym in the
# evidence beside it, so a checkout that runs the mod in place must not be
# able to commit either.
ServerGuard/
__pycache__/
*.lock
!uv.lock
.venv/

# Scratch: every temporary, experimental, or bisect file lives here and is
# never committed. See the org REPOSITORY_STANDARDS.md.
.scratch/
.scratch_*
